{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36218","headline":"赠钱塘湖上唐处士 · 方干","name":"赠钱塘湖上唐处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爱君家似洞庭，冲湾泼岸夜波声。\n蟾蜍影里清吟苦，舴艋舟中白发生。\n常共酒杯爲侣伴，复闻纱帽见公卿。\n莫言举世无知己，自有孤云识此情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《诗人玉屑》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/詩人玉屑_(四庫全書本)）"}